136	    /**
137	     * Derives the owner's locality as the {@code REGION} component of its region-and-hash
138	     * {@code customerCode} (the prefix before the first {@code '-'}). The locality therefore shares
139	     * the customer code's identity rather than being computed independently. When the customer code
140	     * is absent the region is derived directly from the owner's postcode and city via
141	     * {@link #toRegion(Owner)}.
