245	     * Formats the owner's membership number as {@code '<customerCode>-M<YY>'}, where {@code YY} is
246	     * the last two digits of the {@code registrationDate} year, e.g. {@code 'NSW-1A2B3C4D-M26'}. Returns
247	     * {@code null} when either the customer code or the registration date is absent.
