259	     * when a non-blank email is present, plus {@code 1} when the owner has no namesakes
260	     * ({@code namesakeCount} is 0), plus {@code 2} for a household of {@code 3} or more members, plus
261	     * {@code 3} for tenure of more than {@code 365} days since the {@code registrationDate}. This
