291	     * {@code 2} when a non-blank email is present, plus {@code 1} when the owner has no namesakes
292	     * ({@code namesakeCount} is 0), plus {@code 2} when {@code householdSize} is {@code 3} or more,
293	     * plus {@code 3} for tenure of more than {@code 365} days since the {@code registrationDate}.
